  ["How does the coach sound?","Flat and calm",["Angry and loud","Nervous","Excited"],"Calm as a lake at dawn."],
  ["How long until the game?","Two minutes",["Ten minutes","One hour","It has started"],"One hundred and twenty seconds."],
  ["What helps Mia at the end?","Focusing on the ball, the line and her team",["The crowd going quiet","Her coach shouting","Closing her eyes"],"The world shrinks to something she can carry."]
